ted\":null,\"asof_unavailable\":[],\"timing_ms\":{\"fetch\":629,\"evaluate\":13},\"type\":\"market_screen\"}","success":true,"duration_ms":1065,"session_id":"99c8e954-7c38-4859-a15f-6816a4fe5ebf"}

